      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1428",
      "html": "<p>Etymology: Cetopsis comes from the Greek cetos, meaning whale, and -opsis, meaning likeness, in reference to the whale-like appearance. The specific name, sandrae, is in reference to Sandra J. Raredon.</p>"
